// verify/numerics_economics_n1_cost_performance_spread.hexa
// ECONOMICS N1 — closed-form verifier for the Cost-performance spread identity
// + 50× cost-variation claim falsifier semantics.
//
// absorbed from FRONTIER/F5 (cycle-10 reorg · 2026-05-28). FRONTIER meta-domain
// dissolved; cost-performance spread re-homed as ECONOMICS N1 (NOVEL MAIN axis).
//
// Asserts the spread_ratio identity + bidirectional falsifier:
//   (1) spread_ratio identity (max × 100 / min) for the 5-frontier pool
//   (2) all cost values ≥ 0 (cost_x100 range invariant)
//   (3) zero-spread synthetic (all 5 same cost = 100) → spread = 100 (silent)
//   (4) 5-frontier pool fires (spread = 5000 ≥ 5000 · 50× claim 입증)
//   (5) single-family synthetic silent (spread < 1000 · 10× weak claim 도 약화)
//   (6) determinism (recompute identical · recursively delicious)
//   (7) sanity: max ≥ avg ≥ min (basic min/max ordering invariant)
//
// Source: bench/economics_n1_cost_performance_spread.hexa
// External anchors:
//   LXT 2026 — LLM benchmarks 50× cost variation (industry report)
//   Artificial Analysis Index 2026 (artificialanalysis.ai)
